WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.980
- This is a one-man operation.

00:00:07.286 --> 00:00:09.619
I do the whole thing myself.

00:00:11.794 --> 00:00:14.038
The Saguache Crescent is
the last hot-metal newspaper

00:00:14.038 --> 00:00:16.200
in the United States.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.517
And probably about anywhere.

00:00:18.517 --> 00:00:21.184
(languid music)

00:00:28.642 --> 00:00:32.142
My family purchased the newspaper in 1917.

00:00:32.986 --> 00:00:35.152
It's just what we've always done.

00:00:35.152 --> 00:00:37.891
You know, it’s either stay in it or get out,

00:00:37.891 --> 00:00:41.974
and it's easier to stay
in than get out actually.

00:00:43.669 --> 00:00:47.578
I've been working here
since I was 12 years old.

00:00:47.578 --> 00:00:50.328
I've been publisher for 37 years.

00:00:53.345 --> 00:00:55.758
The linotype that I use to set the text

00:00:55.758 --> 00:00:59.591
for the newspaper we
bought brand new in 1921.

00:01:03.078 --> 00:01:05.601
I have about 440 subscribers.

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:07.684
I print about 530 papers.

00:01:08.762 --> 00:01:11.325
We've put in anything that
people want to announce.

00:01:11.325 --> 00:01:14.133
You know, anything that's going on.

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:17.373
A lot of times it's an obituary.

00:01:17.373 --> 00:01:20.440
(hammer taps)

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:21.273
All right.

00:01:25.246 --> 00:01:27.913
(languid music)

00:01:33.914 --> 00:01:36.289
I've just maintained the
traditional printing method

00:01:36.289 --> 00:01:38.032
at The Crescent simply because

00:01:38.032 --> 00:01:41.666
there hasn't been any reason to change.

00:01:41.666 --> 00:01:46.657
I'm not old enough for it to
have completely worn me out.

00:01:46.657 --> 00:01:50.574
I've just been able to
just go on week to week.

00:01:52.166 --> 00:01:53.849
The future of the paper is

00:01:53.849 --> 00:01:56.822
that it'll be put out
next week I'm pretty sure.

00:01:56.822 --> 00:01:59.372
Probably a week after that, and,

00:01:59.372 --> 00:02:01.525
it could be 20 years, it could be two years.

00:02:01.525 --> 00:02:03.343
I don't know.

00:02:03.343 --> 00:02:07.176
I think I'm as amazed
about it as most people.

